{"id":"077255ba47a9a93e","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-term-model-initial.md","title":"Term Model Initiality","display":"thm-term-model-initial — Term Model Initiality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-term-model-initial","aliases":["57-thm-term-model-initial"],"display":"thm-term-model-initial — Term Model Initiality","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]","[[57-df-term-model]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-mod]]","[[57-df-homomorphism]]","[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-henkin-witness]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-term-model-initial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-term-model-initial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-term-model-initial — Term Model Initiality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" href=\"?note=f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" title=\"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability\">57-df-recursive-axiomatizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de630da3be5fd670\" href=\"?note=de630da3be5fd670\" title=\"57-df-term-model\">57-df-term-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f299cb3aecfed079\" href=\"?note=f299cb3aecfed079\" title=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de2e8913ee05cab6\" href=\"?note=de2e8913ee05cab6\" title=\"57-df-homomorphism\">57-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8a3ea6c384666db\" href=\"?note=e8a3ea6c384666db\" title=\"57-df-henkin-witness\">57-df-henkin-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxCon}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxCon}(T)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T(T)\">\\(\\mathfrak T(T)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"de630da3be5fd670\" href=\"?note=de630da3be5fd670\" title=\"57-df-term-model\">57-df-term-model</a> 构造。同态取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"de2e8913ee05cab6\" href=\"?note=de2e8913ee05cab6\" title=\"57-df-homomorphism\">57-df-homomorphism</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f299cb3aecfed079\" href=\"?note=f299cb3aecfed079\" title=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialObj}(K,\\mathfrak J)\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialObj}(K,\\mathfrak J)\\)</span> 是下式的初始对象谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\">\\(\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\\)</span> 在本文件的适用域内选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T(T)\">\\(\\mathfrak T(T)\\)</span> 为代表；此选择不声称所有同构副本字面相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialObj}(K,\\mathfrak J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak J\\in K\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K\\;\\exists!h\\;\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak J,\\mathfrak A,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InitialObj}(K,\\mathfrak J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak J\\in K\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in K\\;\\exists!h\\;\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak J,\\mathfrak A,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialObj}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T),\\mathfrak T(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InitialObj}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T),\\mathfrak T(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\\coloneqq\\mathfrak T(T),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak T(T)\\cong\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T))\\coloneqq\\mathfrak T(T),\\qquad\n\\mathfrak T(T)\\cong\\mathrm{Initial}(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\;\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\mathfrak T(T),\\mathfrak A)\\quad h:\\lvert\\mathfrak T(T)\\rvert\\to|\\mathfrak A|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\;\\exists!h\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\mathfrak T(T),\\mathfrak A)\\quad h:\\lvert\\mathfrak T(T)\\rvert\\to|\\mathfrak A|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>真正的内容是到每个 T-模型的唯一同态；Initial 的代表选择只是补齐原来未定义的调用。这里的项模型必须满足其极大一致、Henkin 和非空闭项域条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability","status":"resolved","id":"f09872a0e6f9cd1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"de630da3be5fd670","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-mod","status":"resolved","id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-mod]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"de2e8913ee05cab6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-henkin-witness","status":"resolved","id":"e8a3ea6c384666db","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-henkin-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"b82abcee4938fc49","anchor":"ref-9","targ